[{"title":"情诗其十五","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"日暮瞒得众人行，却向宠犬语叮咛。\n慎勿说道人已去，归时禅院近黎明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":399,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"情诗其十六","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"昨趁夜色赴幽期，鹅羽纷纷晓来迷。\n两行屐痕深雪里，教人如何不得知？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":400,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"情诗其十四","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"曾慕鸳鸯效双栖，南谷林深叶迷离。\n除却鹦哥谁人晓，莫将幽情向人啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":401,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"情诗其三","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"西风吹谢花成泥，蜂蝶每向香尘泣。\n情犹未了缘已尽，笺前莫赋断肠诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":402,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"情诗其三十","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"美颜无双处处夸，玉帐香肌娇无那。\n夜夜伴得鸳鸯宿，不羡旖旎上林花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":403,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"情诗其五","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"锦葵原自恋金蜂，谁供花颜奉神灵。\n欲舞轻翼入殿里，偷向坛前伴卿卿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":404,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"情诗其六","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"入山投谒得道僧，求教上师说因明。\n争奈相思无拘检，意马心猿到卿卿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":405,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"情诗其四","author":"仓央嘉措","text":"欲题新词寄娇娘，风吹雨蚀半微茫。\n我有相思千般意，百磨不灭铭肝肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":406,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"民歌","author":"无名氏","text":"坐催中门鸡乱啼，送人离别水东西。\n挽水东流想无法，从今不养五更鸡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":407,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山歌 其二","author":"黄遵宪","text":"人人要结后生缘，侬只今生结目前。\n一十二时不离别，郎行郎坐总随肩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":408,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"山歌 其六","author":"黄遵宪","text":"一家女儿做新娘，十家女儿看镜光。\n街头铜鼓声声打，打着中心只说郎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":409,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"望潼关","author":"峻德","text":"立马风陵望汉关，三峰高出白云间。\n西来一曲昆仑水，划断中条太华山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":410,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄怀曹雪芹","author":"敦诚","text":"少陵昔赠曹将军，曾曰魏武之子孙。\n君又无乃将军后，于今环堵蓬蒿屯。\n扬州旧梦久以绝，且著临邛犊鼻裈。\n爱君诗笔有才气，直追昌谷破篱樊。\n当时虎门数晨夕，西窗剪烛风雨昏。\n接䍦倒着容君傲，高谈雄辩虱手扪。\n感时思君不相见，蓟门落日松亭樽。\n劝君莫弹食客铗，劝君莫扣富儿门。\n残羹冷炙有德色，不如著书黄叶村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":411,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送张坦公方伯出塞","author":"丁澎","text":"老去悲长剑，胡为独远征？\n半生戎马换，片语玉关行。\n乱石冲云走，飞沙撼碛鸣。\n万方新雨露，吹不到边城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":412,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"同阎大湖上步月","author":"万寿祺","text":"残霭动疏林，平畴入远浔。\n月圆今夕话，风碎隔年心。\n蹙蹙江湖窄，瞿瞿天地深。\n偶传消息好，喜慰一登临。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":413,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"行脚","author":"万寿祺","text":"杖钵孤踪去，凄其驿路间。\n水喧沂北道，风撼穆南关。\n飞鸟移前浦，归云满故山。\n五年江上客，今有几人还？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":414,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"访韩圣秋于乌龙潭，韩时将远去","author":"万寿祺","text":"乌龙潭上泛菰蒲，舴艋三舟酒百壶。\n一息尚存犹道路，千秋所恃在江湖。\n西京冠剑曾前席，南国莺花入大都。\n我始逢君君欲去，柳稊初放听啼乌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":415,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送严大南旋","author":"万寿祺","text":"残菊淮西路，西风淹问津。\n三年同梦客，千里送归人。\n惭愧余知己，凄凉卜旧邻。\n怜君天下士，今在五湖滨！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":416,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻雁","author":"万寿祺","text":"此夕初闻雁，居然知异乡。\n惊心万里月，回首一年霜。\n未敢同胡越，非因谋稻粱。\n天涯沦落者，半夜起彷徨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":417,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"答王大","author":"万寿祺","text":"楚州风雨夜徘徊，千里双淮极望开。\n回首渔矶多避世，惊心乔木一登台。\n二陵残黍西风急，十郡寒笳北吹哀。\n君自冥冥修雁羽，苍茫海国独归来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":418,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"嘉禾寄怀巢端明先生山居","author":"万斯备","text":"戎马偏南国，荆扉独隐沦。\n琴书娱白发，板荡失青春。\n世事袁闳老，生涯阮籍贫。\n向来高蹈志，寂绝更谁邻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":419,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"青莲寺","author":"干建邦","text":"斜渡溪桥一刹悬，行人报道是青莲。\n同来揽秀无今古，到底巢云孰后先。\n盟誓几疑穿石骨，风流恰喜绕垆烟。\n徘徊胜迹岿然在，感慨徒生落照前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":420,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"北固山看大江","author":"孔尚任","text":"孤城铁瓮四山围，绝顶高秋坐落晖。\n眼见长江趋大海，青天却似向西飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":421,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送牧堂上人游五台","author":"孔尚任","text":"层崖翠接尉蓝天，百太清风待皎然。\n古雪难消山北面，春莺懒到寺东边。\n经色渡水何妨湿，衲袖穿花更觉鲜。\n不比人间行路苦，离情也废一宵眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":422,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"点绛唇  避暑","author":"文廷式","text":"扇力微微，晚风乍喜吹衣带。\n兰台赋在。\n一霎炎光改。\n?竹当窗，画意凭谁会。\n吟天籁，琴声自解。\n曲罢龙归海。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":423,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河传","author":"文廷式","text":"宵静。\n灯烬。\n月临窗。\n瓜架虫声送凉。\n怨君忆君清漏长。\n罗裳。\n近来销旧香。\n锦字书成情默默。\n亲手织。\n要胜春花色。\n茧多丝，柳多枝。\n罘罳。\n晓风千里吹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":424,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"长相思","author":"文廷式","text":"钿箜篌。\n纤指柔。\n一曲吴歌不上喉。\n时时饧倦眸。\n锦缠头。\n金带钩。\n细喘轻颦博得不。\n谁知离别愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":425,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虞美人  乙未四月作","author":"文廷式","text":"无情潮水声呜咽。\n夜夜鹃啼血。\n几番芳讯问天涯。\n不道明朝、已是隔墙花。\n夕阳送客咸阳道。\n休讶归期早。\n铜沟新涨出宫墙。\n海便成田、容易莫栽桑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":426,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"念奴娇","author":"文廷式","text":"一村临水，乍迎风含笑、野桃春媚。\n秾艳波光相映发，惆怅无情有思。\n燕子不来，东风容易，目断芳尘委。\n高鬟愁极，更烦筝响料理。\n休说前度刘郎，重来不见，锁赤城霞气。\n路转峰前征骑影，咫尺便迷千里。\n芳草连云，岩花拂袖，驿馆空庭闭。\n梦来无寐，廋词聊托麻纸。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":427,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六月","author":"方文","text":"六月重衾更着绵，阴寒浑似暮秋天。\n我生半百何曾见？\n记是康熙丙午年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":428,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"春水新添几尺波，泛舟小妇解吴歌。\n笑指侬如江上月，团圆时少缺时多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":429,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"侬家住在大江东，妾似船桅郎似逢。\n船桅一心在篷里，篷无定向只随风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":430,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"金丝烟是草中妖，天下何人喙不焦？\n闻说内廷新有禁，微醺不敢厕宫僚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":431,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"投认师生法不轻，其初只为杜逢迎。\n因而场屋真知己，怀刺无他止姓名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":432,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"都门本是利名关，来去纷纷各不闲。\n亦有京官十数载，从无偷眼看西山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":433,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"自昔旃裘与酪浆，而今啜茗又焚香。\n雄心尽向蛾眉老，争肯捐躯入战场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":434,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"前朝勋戚盛如云，后裔同归厮养群。\n莫向灞陵嗔醉尉，何人犹识故将军？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":435,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"东戍榆关西渡河，今人不及古人多。\n风吹草低牛羊见，更有谁能敕勒歌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":436,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"有客慈仁古寺中，苍龙鳞畔泣春风。\n布衣自有布衣语，不与簪绅朝士同。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":437,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"故老田居好是闲，无端荐起列鸳班。\n一朝谪去上阳堡，始悔从前躁出山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":438,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"都下竹枝词","author":"方文","text":"自古长安似弈棋，一番客到一番悲。\n许多大老休官去，几个名娼又嫁谁？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":439,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月十九日作 其一","author":"方文","text":"年年今日强登高，独立南峰北向号。\n漫野玄云天色晦，美人黄土我心劳。\n虚疑杨柳牵愁绪，不忍沧浪鉴鬓毛。\n前辈有谁同此恨，雪庵和尚读离骚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":440,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月十九日作 其二","author":"方文","text":"野老难忘故国恩，年年恸哭向江门。\n南徐郭外三停棹，北固山头独怆魂。\n流水滔滔何日返，遗民落落几人存。\n钱生未死重相见，双袖龙钟尽血痕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":441,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"太湖避兵","author":"方文","text":"将近枫桥路，唯闻人语喧。\n北来兵肆掠，东去艇皆奔。\n震泽烟波迥，高秋风雨繁。\n此时期免患，艰苦复何论。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":442,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水崖哭明圃子留","author":"方文","text":"圣代遗民本不多，频年锋镝又销磨。\n衰宗尚剩农兼圃，至性同归笠与蓑。\n只道阳春回律管，岂知长夜闭烟萝。\n瑶华且受霜风折，冉冉孤根奈若何？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":443,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水崖哭明圃子留","author":"方文","text":"少小能文气似兰，里人谁不信弹冠。\n只因丧乱身当废，纵使沉埋性所安。\n故国有怀唯涕泪，新诗无字不悲酸。\n漫劳铁匣藏枯井，此日流传血已丹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":444,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水崖哭明圃子留","author":"方文","text":"里门裘马日纷纷，鸾鹤宁同鸡鹜群？\n如以衣冠坐涂炭，不徒富贵等浮云。\n家人愚暗还相劝，异类腥臊孰忍闻？\n十世国恩蒙者众，独将破衲报明君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":445,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"水崖哭明圃子留","author":"方文","text":"忆昔相携吴楚游，日同匕箸夜同裯。\n奇欢东坝千钟酒，苦恨西湖一叶舟。\n共把愁心对陵阙，独将佳句播沧洲。\n河山犹未归尧禹，痛尔飘零先白头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":446,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"会试榜发，久不得报，有怀同社诸子","author":"方文","text":"诸生皆耆旧，亡何试礼闱。\n便应骧首去，未许倦怀归。\n辇下新朝服，山中老布衣。\n高鹏与低鴳，各自一行飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":447,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"客有教予谨言者，口占谢之","author":"方文","text":"野老生来不媚人，况逢世变益嶙峋。\n诗中愤懑妻常戒，酒后颠狂客每嗔。\n自分余年随运尽，却无奇祸赖家贫。\n从今卜筑深山里，朝夕渔樵一任真。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":448,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"含鄱岭至太乙峰","author":"方文","text":"侵晨独出含鄱口，千里鄱湖一岭函。\n但使短藤穷碧献，何妨细雨湿青衫。\n林中黯淡高低树，雾里微茫上下帆。\n不是探奇索隐者，谁能踏雪履岩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":449,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戊子避乱舟中寄弟","author":"方琬","text":"野树鸣蝉咽未休，蓼花蘋叶晚来秋。\n干戈满眼惊残梦，风雨伤心逐去舟。\n丧乱相依吾弟在，艰危无奈老亲忧。\n更怜宿草青青冢，寒食新烟望里愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":450,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"读书堂","author":"毛德琦","text":"才高诚与命相妨，泥饮方知醉是乡。\n率土尽传供奉曲，匡山尚有读书堂。\n松元犹染宫袍湿，岩壑常沾翰墨香。\n回忆少陵头白句，蜀笺曾寄到浔阳。\n宛然群揖出风烟，五老相期太古前。\n岂易巢松留此地，何难吏隐卜他年。\n招来采石江头月，照彻匡庐山外天。\n更拟筑台祠大雅，黄金先铸李青莲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":451,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"江上","author":"王士祯","text":"吴头楚尾路如何，烟雨秋深暗自波。\n晚趁寒潮渡江去，满林黄叶雁声多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":452,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"余澹心寄金陵咏怀古迹诗却寄","author":"王士禛","text":"千古秦淮水，东流绕旧京。\n江南戎马后，愁杀庾兰成。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":453,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冶春","author":"王士祯","text":"今有东风太狡狯，弄晴作雨遣春来。\n江梅一夜落红雪，便有夭桃无数开。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":454,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冶春","author":"王士祯","text":"东风花事到江城，早有人家唤卖饧。\n他日相思忘不得，平山堂下五清明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":455,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冶春","author":"王士祯","text":"三月韶光画不成，寻春步屟可怜生。\n青芜不见隋宫殿，一种垂杨万古情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":456,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初春济南作","author":"王士祯","text":"山郡逢春复乍晴，陂塘分出几泉清？\n郭边万户皆临水，雪后千峰半入城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":457,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"青玉峡","author":"王士祯","text":"庐南万古峡，常有野云封。\n朝来雷雨过，白日下飞龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":458,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"真州绝句","author":"王士祯","text":"江干多是钓人居，柳陌菱塘一带疏。\n好是日斜风定后，半江红树卖鲈鱼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":459,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"真州绝句","author":"王士祯","text":"江乡春事最堪怜，寒食清明欲禁烟。\n残月晓风仙掌路，何人为吊柳屯田？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":460,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮杂诗","author":"王士祯","text":"当年赐第有辉光，开国中山异姓王。\n莫问万春圆旧事，朱门草没大功坊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":461,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮杂诗","author":"王士祯","text":"青溪水木最清华，王谢乌衣六代夸。\n不奈更耐江总宅，寒烟已失段侯家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":462,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮杂诗","author":"王士祯","text":"傅寿清歌妙嫩箫，红牙子玉夜相邀。\n而今明月空如水，不见青溪长板桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":463,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秦淮杂诗","author":"王士祯","text":"年来肠断秣陵舟，梦绕秦淮水上楼。\n十日雨丝风片里，浓春艳景似残秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":464,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再过露筋祠 其一","author":"王士禛","text":"新歌细字写冰纨，小部君王带笑看。\n千载秦淮呜咽水，不应仍恨孔都官。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":465,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高邮雨泊","author":"王士祯","text":"寒雨秦邮夜泊船，南湖新涨水连天。\n风流不见秦淮海，寂寞人间五百年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":466,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"悼亡诗","author":"王士祯","text":"陌上莺啼细草薰，鱼鳞风皱水成纹。\n江南红豆相思苦，岁岁花开一忆君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":467,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新滩","author":"王士祯","text":"兵书峡口石横流，怒敌江心万斛舟。\n蜀舸吴船齐著力，西陵前去赛黄牛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":468,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题秋江独钓图","author":"王士祯","text":"一蓑一笠一扁舟，一丈丝纶一寸钩。\n一曲高歌一樽酒，一人独钓一江秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":469,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题聊斋志异","author":"王士祯","text":"姑妄言之姑听之，豆棚瓜架雨如丝。\n料因厌作人间语，爱听秋坟鬼唱时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":470,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"息斋夜宿即事怀故园","author":"王士祯","text":"夜来微雨歇，河汉在西堂。\n萤火出深碧，池荷闻暗香。\n开窗邻竹树，高枕忆沧浪。\n此夕南枝鸟，无因到故乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":471,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]